<p>Firms may also respond to higher costs by raising their output prices. 64% of firms responding to the latest DMP survey are expecting to increase prices as a response to energy costs over the next year. And the average of firms&rsquo; own output price growth expectations for the year ahead was 4.4% in April, compared with 3.4% in January (Chart B.3). </p>
