    <p>ASBC &ndash; Agents&rsquo; summary of business conditions.</p>
    <p>AWE &ndash; average weekly earnings.</p>
    <p>BICS &ndash; Business Insights and Conditions Survey.</p>
    <p>CCS &ndash; Credit Conditions Survey.</p>
    <p>COMPASS &ndash; Central Organising Model for Projection Analysis and Scenario Simulation.</p>
    <p>CPI &ndash; consumer prices index.</p>
